真好  我没有助理
That's great. I-I don't have assistants.

311
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:42,710
这大概就是在私企的福利之一
Oh. I guess that's one of the benefits of being in the private sector.

312
00:13:42,710 --> 00:13:45,630
有助理  钱还挣得多
That and all the money I make.

313
